  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "記憶體元件導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO MEMORY DEVICES",
    "describe_ch": "學生將藉由本課程認識與學習各式半導體記憶體元件之歷史發展與基本工作原理，並透過文獻實例說明，讓學生了解其相關之元件技術與應用，以期符合學業界所需之人才。",
    "describe_eh": "Students will understand and learn the historical development and the fundamental operation principles of various types of memory devices, and their related devices technologies and applications.",
